<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>World | Deutsche Welle</title><subtitle type="html">World | Deutsche Welle</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-world</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-world" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-world" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Germany says Russia behind attempted drone attack at Leipzig airport</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:29153ed17d536f0651c695a1bc889b4c833faae0cdca3b358c25ec3fb245a8bc</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T22:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-says-russia-behind-attempted-drone-attack-at-leipzig-airport/a-78584589--38d4d0353c74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-says-russia-behind-attempted-drone-attack-at-leipzig-airport/a-78584589?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Investigators believe an explosives-laden drone was deliberately targeting a Ukrainian cargo aircraft at Leipzig/Halle airport in early August. The German government said on Tuesday that it held Russia "responsible."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Congo's Ebola caseload tops 6,000 as concerns grow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3417219734c95bb59d7650726462d68ed58c316570ba26fdd9b363159a4c1688</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T18:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/congo-s-ebola-caseload-tops-6-000-as-concerns-grow/a-78638447--c2dd272f865b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/congo-s-ebola-caseload-tops-6-000-as-concerns-grow/a-78638447?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Ebola outbreak in the Democratic Republic of Congo has surpassed 6,000 confirmed cases, with nearly 3,000 deaths. As the virus spreads, authorities are racing to contain one of the deadliest outbreaks in history.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>War and sanctions deepen Iran's fuel crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:93fcd41e350f58cfd8d688fdf552bc30d3c5e508d56c9aeacabcd62e246e010d</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T14:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/war-and-sanctions-deepen-iran-s-fuel-crisis/a-78636429--441d2153604c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/war-and-sanctions-deepen-iran-s-fuel-crisis/a-78636429?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Long lines at fuel stations are spreading across Iran as war damage, import constraints and new US sanctions squeeze supplies.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Mladic's death, Bosnia and Serbia's unfinished reckoning</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eca652077849b86bc795773946c7591f435b73bd830f3cb0e094be1d584f831b</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T13:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mladic-s-death-bosnia-and-serbia-s-unfinished-reckoning/a-78602733--19ecd75a4666.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mladic-s-death-bosnia-and-serbia-s-unfinished-reckoning/a-78602733?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The death of Ratko Mladic did not close a dark chapter of European history; it reopened old wounds. The ideology that created him lives on. The Dayton peace agreement ended the war, not the divisions that produced it.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Will Bangladesh join the Mecca defense alliance?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e11c8995e83716a5558e65e9a097754829981785a955e19464197b6bd973e298</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-bangladesh-join-the-mecca-defense-alliance/a-78613944--a9c557768a92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-bangladesh-join-the-mecca-defense-alliance/a-78613944?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While Bangladesh weighs the risks of signing the Mecca Joint Defense Agreement, experts warn that such a move could complicate relations with neighboring India.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Norway's new King Haakon VIII takes oath in parliament</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fd3b2548684ba8b71e6456c85da872fdff4d0ffcaea64d6385a0cc040459e22a</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-s-new-king-haakon-viii-takes-oath-in-parliament/a-78606923--1723f25a617f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-s-new-king-haakon-viii-takes-oath-in-parliament/a-78606923?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new king swore to uphold the constitution in parliament in Oslo, the first major institutional step of his reign. Haakon VIII's wife Queen Mette-Marit had to skip the event in the aftermath of her lung transplant.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal flood: Death toll tops 1,000 as rescue continues</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:596874391b62e9b9407355499cceefd910759fa7156378d9065fa5936b7875bd</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T10:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-death-toll-tops-1-000-as-rescue-continues/a-78589460--79d1a5a29fe8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-death-toll-tops-1-000-as-rescue-continues/a-78589460?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nepalese authorities say 4,000 people remain unaccounted for as rescue teams with search dogs comb through mud, rocks and debris.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US irks Germany, Europe with Russian G20 invite, press bans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3fc29d15f74b4486e4e5ab6baaccecb00cec81ac1209e7348be954ca0ddf82ce</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T10:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-irks-germany-europe-with-russian-g20-invite-press-bans/a-78583919--0e3658fe72cb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-irks-germany-europe-with-russian-g20-invite-press-bans/a-78583919?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia's finance minister is at the G20 meeting in Asheville but some key US press corps members are not. The mood was already tense amid the lengthy Iran war and Trump's renewed beef with neighbor Canada.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Can new Apple CEO John Ternus fix the tech giant's AI woes?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9a22618bcb3c8d47166b7a0ee2622ed130d17a72b99e33f59aa76a6a8bf4c8ee</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T09:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-new-apple-ceo-john-ternus-fix-the-tech-giant-s-ai-woes/a-78575898--3dbcd845fd90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-new-apple-ceo-john-ternus-fix-the-tech-giant-s-ai-woes/a-78575898?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">John Ternus is just the third Apple CEO in 30 years. His primary challenge is to correct the company's faltering AI strategy to preserve its position as a big tech leader.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Lionel Messi announces retirement from international football</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e5fcd70e766fd23ca7cb84df38a19010cedf2d6af5589c53e20a239f994bc36e</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T15:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/lionel-messi-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-78579502--40b32b537f9f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/lionel-messi-announces-retirement-from-international-football/a-78579502?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Argentine legend announced that he will not play for the national team again, ending an illustrious international career.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How China buried Tibet flood images after Nepal disaster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:38aded01db10c4ad1cab2dfad25edfac79dd398b88db8055f68c3a8cfdb4dae3</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472--f156a9510413.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In Tibet, a digital crackdown followed the deadly flood that has devastated communities along the China-Nepal border. Censors erased viral footage while Chinese state media flooded platforms with official content.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Deceived and deployed: How young Cameroonians end up fighting in Russia's war in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3d9ebf41301ac6978d4797f91290ebefb2a97abb76f718eca22ce63e310e2666</id><updated>2026-09-02T04:46:37Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/deceived-and-deployed-how-young-cameroonians-end-up-fighting-in-russia-s-war-in-ukraine/a-78513256--672bb0ec1fd8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/deceived-and-deployed-how-young-cameroonians-end-up-fighting-in-russia-s-war-in-ukraine/a-78513256?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Analysts say economic desperation and fraudulent recruitment schemes are funneling Cameroonian youth into the Russian military — with deadly consequences.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
